WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Lesson 02. What you are going to need.

2
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Educational content only. Not financial advice. Trading involves risk; you can lose money.

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:28.974
Write the page before any screen.

4
00:00:28.974 --> 00:00:35.040
Fill seven lines from the summer window, on paper.

5
00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:40.040
Keep every secret off that page.

6
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:45.040
Mark the page Example so it cannot be read as an order.

7
00:00:45.040 --> 00:01:05.483
Seven lines. The pair is the public series.

8
00:01:05.483 --> 00:01:28.760
Range, levels, stop. All three from the same window.

9
00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:42.795
No key. No balance. Public closes only.

10
00:01:42.795 --> 00:01:53.760
The whole window stays on screen.

11
00:01:53.760 --> 00:02:15.471
19 July 2023. Close 29,914.

12
00:02:15.471 --> 00:02:37.183
8 August 2023. Close 29,765.

13
00:02:37.183 --> 00:02:59.341
24 August 2023. Close 26,162.

14
00:02:59.341 --> 00:03:21.524
13 September 2023. Close 26,228.

15
00:03:21.524 --> 00:03:43.703
29 September 2023. Close 26,912.

16
00:03:43.703 --> 00:04:05.666
16 October 2023. Close 28,519.

17
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:17.040
A tick with no sentence fails the check.

18
00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:22.040
The page comes before the screen.

19
00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:27.040
The figures are the summer low, the summer high, and six gaps.

20
00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:32.040
Secrets stay off the page. Example stays on it.

